# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, so Biome's LF
# formatting and the `pnpm gate` behave identically on Windows, macOS, Linux,
# and CI. Without this, Windows autocrlf flips files to CRLF on checkout and the
# gate can go red locally while green on CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never line-ending-munge binary assets.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
